  << /ActualText (Mental Health \046 Digital Challenges Among Students\072\nStudies show\2401 in 3 students\240experience anxiety\054 stress\054 or burnout during academic life\056\nIn India\054 youth aged\24015\02324\240are among the most emotionally vulnerable yet least likely to seek help\056\nConstant screen exposure\054 notifications\054 and academic pressure contribute to\240digital fatigue and reduced focus\056\nStudents often avoid traditional mental health apps due to\240stigma\054 complexity\054 or clinical tone\056\nThere is a growing need for a\240non\055judgmental\054 simple\054 and daily\055use support system\240rather than therapy\055based solutions\056)
